{"EmbedController accepts embed_url without upfront sanitization, delegating validation to downstream URI parsing, and lacks DNS/IP-level SSRF protection": 0.7441306710243225, "EmbedController#ensure_embeddable validates referer host against SiteSetting.embeddable_host and raises Discourse::InvalidAccess if validation fails, but sets X-Frame-Options to ALLOWALL on success which may have security implications": 0.43989068269729614, "TopicEmbed.import_remote uses open(url).read to fetch remote content but never requires 'open-uri', causing a NoMethodError in environments where it isn't auto-loaded": 0.8065401315689087, "Template renders post content with raw post.cooked which bypasses Rails HTML escaping, allowing XSS if external content from RSS/Readability includes script tags or malicious markup": 0.7404083609580994, "Migration creates topic_embeds table with force: true which will drop the table if it already exists, risking data loss in existing environments": 0.6001144647598267}